- Human Bingo — (6–50 people, 15–25 min): Bingo cards with traits; people find others who match. Great for mingling.
- Speed Networking — (Any size, 20–40 min): Timed one-on-one rounds with prompts. Good for larger groups.
- Marshmallow Challenge — (Teams of 3–5, 20–30 min): Build the tallest tower using spaghetti, tape, string, and a marshmallow. Great for teamwork and design thinking.
- Common Ground — (Groups of 4–8, 10–20 min): Small groups list things they all share; first group to reach a target number wins. Fast and inclusive.
- Show & Tell — (Any size, 15–30 min): Bring or describe an object with personal meaning. Builds connection.
- Quick Scavenger Hunt — (Any size, 15–30 min): Items or photo tasks around the venue/office. Active and fun.
- Would You Rather — (Any size, 10–20 min): Rapid-fire preference questions to spark laughs and conversation.

